        "generate": true,
        "transparent": false,
        "prompt": "Flat graphic-design background on a square canvas, clean vector-style shapes with crisp edges, no photography. A solid deep brand-color field (this template: crimson red, #9B1F1F) covers almost the whole canvas. Accent colors: a very dark navy (this template: #023649), a muted dusty pink (this template: #CD8E8E) and white. Bottom-left corner: a cluster of long, thin diagonal stripes in navy, dusty pink and light grey-blue fanning in from the left and bottom edges, covering roughly the lowest 20% of the left edge. Bottom-right corner: two parallel white diagonal bands running from the right edge at about two-thirds of the way down to the bottom edge, with a small white triangle in the very corner. Top-right corner: a small navy and dusty-pink diagonal stripe accent tucked into the corner. Across the lower middle, at about 74–79% of the way down, a row of three identical small navy tab badges evenly spaced (starting about 8%, 35% and 62% across): each is a small rounded navy tab with a thin white diagonal arrow pointing up-right inside it, and a thin navy underline extending from the tab's bottom edge to the right for about three times the tab's width. Everything else — the whole upper and middle area — is plain, even red with no shapes. IMPORTANT: no circles, rings, photos, people or pictures anywhere in the image; the circular photos are separate layers. No text, lettering, logos or watermarks anywhere in the image.",
        "reference_url": "https://assets.quickhub.ai/qh-templates-2/personaservices40.png",
        "notes": "All of the design's text (kicker, title, supporting sentence, the three feature labels) and the logo are WHITE and sit on the left 8–75% of the canvas, so the main field must stay a saturated, medium-to-dark color that white reads clearly on — never pastel, pale, cream or near-white, even if a brief asks for light or soft tones (put those in the accent stripes instead). The three navy arrow tabs with their underlines are load-bearing: each feature label sits just right of its tab, above its underline, so keep them in the lower-middle row at the positions described. The reference photo currently on this layer has three photos in circles baked in by mistake — a regenerated background must not contain any circle, ring or photo; the three circular photos are separate layers on top. Note that the large top-right photo's navy ring currently comes only from this reference image, so a regenerated background will show that photo without a ring."
      },
      "text_layer_count": 6,
